inal 3 seed resumes (Product Designer Resume, Marketing Manager Resume, Software Engineer Resume) - both newly created resumes and all their edits were completely lost. A DOM check confirmed localStorage and sessionStorage are both empty, indicating the app holds resume data only in transient in-memory state with no persistence layer, so any created, edited, duplicated, or renamed resume does not survive a page reload.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-21\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No validation feedback shown when attempting to rename resume to whitespace-only title\", \"actual\": \"Clicked the resume title to edit, entered '   ' (whitespace only) and pressed Enter. The title correctly reverted to the previous 'Untitled Resume' (title was not changed to blank), but no toast, inline error, or any other validation feedback message was displayed to inform the user why the change was rejected.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"All field edits (contact, summary, experience, education, skills) and template switches (Modern/Classic/Minimal) appeared instantly in the Live Preview panel with no save/refresh action required.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Section visibility toggle and reorder (Skills moved above Education) updated Live Preview immediately without any save action.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"After extensive editing across Contact/Summary/Experience/Education/Skills/Template/Sections tabs and renaming, navigating back to dashboard shows the resume card 'QA Engineer Application' with 'Updated Aug 24, 2026' (today's date) reflecting the edits.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"With all 5 sections populated (Contact, Summary, 3 Experience entr